## Interface: 120007
## Title: Shield Overlay
## Notes: /shield to move, /shield reset to default, /shield hide/show to show/hide the shield bar, /shield party to refresh party frames, 20%-200% functional shield bar, shows shield overlays in raid/player/party frames. The addon also has mode AlwaysInParty ,in case it disappears type /shield party (it happens when u enter edit mode). Minimal addon for blizzard original raid/party UI, dont attempt to use with other UIs.
